WEBVTT

NOTE Transcript of the narration

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.900
BizOn Bật Nghiệp. A 3D
clay business simulation.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.300
Welcome to the clay HQ in Cần Thơ.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.600
Tap a department or a
teammate to get to work.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.200
Meet your team.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.900
At the CEO's decision table,

6
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.300
drag the clay knobs for
price, marketing and output.

7
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.500
Meet as a team, then commit.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Three AI rivals push back,

9
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
and market events shake things up.

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.400
Keep your margin and stay profitable.

11
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.300
Win the top market share with a profit,

12
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.800
and your flag goes up.

13
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.100
Six rounds:

14
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:55.200
Cần Thơ, Hồ Chí Minh City, Khánh Hòa,
Đà Nẵng, Thanh Hóa, and finally Hà Nội.

15
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.300
Chat with Lumina AI, your mentor Hương,

16
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:02.000
for what-if advice, and let
Rồng Xanh check your numbers.

17
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.300
Between rounds, play Clay Factory Frenzy,

18
00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:11.100
visit the shop, grow your skill
tree and complete missions.

19
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.600
Data tells us the past;

20
00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:16.000
today's decisions write the future.

21
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.500
Finish the season, lift the
trophy and earn your certificate.

22
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.100
BizOn Bật Nghiệp. Play the 3D HQ today.
